{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791904800, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T15:20:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T15:21:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791904860, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T15:20:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15199, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市容愈來越差\n沒有遮陽的樹 路上垃圾桶常是滿出來\n不要只會滅鼠 從基本解決問題", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.15,199", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T15:20:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46463, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "為什麼松山區富民公園要亂砍樹，真的很不開心。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.46,463", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T15:20:22+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35215, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "教育", "content": "我是國小生，學校營養午餐都蠻難吃的，尤其是螢光咖喱請加油", "display_name": "中正代表 No.35,215", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T15:20:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48340, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "過辛亥隧道往木柵方向路邊有好幾棵樹被砍，樹洞被水泥封住，那些用水泥封住的樹洞還有機會重新種樹嗎？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.48,340", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T15:20:46+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16488, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北的路真的都很不平，常常舖好又挖掉，永遠都不平整，身為機車族，真的很希望路可以舖好。", "display_name": "文山代表 鈺茹 (馬力)", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 46463, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.46,463", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 35215, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.35,215", "district": "zhongz